#. 聞きたくありません
msgctxt "0001 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Not at all!"
msgstr "Không cần đâu!"

#. 聞かせてください
msgctxt "0002 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Absolutely!"
msgstr "Chắc chắn rồi!"

#. <CLT 23>これまでは、<CLT><CLT 3>トドメ<CLT><CLT 23>は<CLT><CLT 3>%CTRL_FINAL_STRIKE%<CLT><CLT 23>を押せば、
#. 特に考える必要もございませんでしたが…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>So far, you've probably been pressing the <CLT><CLT 3>%CTRL_FINAL_STRIKE%<CLT><CLT 23>\n"
"during your <CLT><CLT 3>Final Strike<CLT><CLT 23> without a second thought.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>ここからは、トドメの際に、
#. あなた様に<CLT><CLT 3>推理<CLT><CLT 23>をして頂きます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>But from now on, you're gonna have to pay a little\n"
"<CLT><CLT 3>extra attention<CLT><CLT 23> to your finishing blow.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>トドメに使う<CLT><CLT 3>言弾（コトダマ）<CLT><CLT 23>を、
#. きちんとお選び頂かなければなりません。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Now you'll have to choose the proper <CLT><CLT 3>Truth Bullet<CLT><CLT 23> to\n"
"use during your coup de grace.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>選び方<CLT><CLT 23>は、ノンストップ議論と同じでございます。
#. <CLT><CLT 3>%CTRL_QUICK_SELECT%<CLT><CLT 23>をお使いください%CTRL_SCROLL_ALT%
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>You'll <CLT><CLT 3>select it<CLT><CLT 23> the same way as during the Nonstop\n"
"Debate—simply press the <CLT><CLT 3>%CTRL_QUICK_SELECT%<CLT><CLT 23>%CTRL_SCROLL_ALT%\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>議論と同様、推理難易度が“ユルヤカ”以下ですと、
#. 言弾（コトダマ）の装填数が少なくなりますが…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Also like the debate, if your Logic Difficulty is set\n"
"to Kind, you'll have fewer bullets to choose from.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>今回のバトルだけは、推理難易度“イジワル”と
#. 同様の装填数にさせて頂きます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>But for educational purposes, we're going to pretend\n"
"you're set to Mean regardless. Just this once, okay?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>そろそろ物語も後半戦でしょうか…
#. ご健闘をお祈り致します。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Oh, by the way! You're about halfway through the game\n"
"now! Go you!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>以上、ご確認のほど、よろしくお願い致します。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Well then...good luck, and have fun!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>Vậy thôi... chúc bạn may mắn và chơi game vui vẻ!\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 23>マシンガントークバトルに<CLT><CLT 3>新要素が追加<CLT><CLT 23>されます。
#. 説明をお聞きになりますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>A <CLT><CLT 3>new element has been added<CLT><CLT 23> to Bullet Time Battles.\n"
"Would you like to hear more?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>Một <CLT><CLT 3>yếu tố mới đã được thêm vào<CLT><CLT 23> Đấu Khẩu Súng Máy. Bạn\n"
"có muốn nghe thêm không?\n"
"<CLT>"
